longevity-by-grinding-skills:
Xu Yunfan has become a Mining Slave in the mines beneath the Mining Supervision Office.
Wielding a Skill Level panel that allows the Cultivation of any technique in the world, he surges forward triumphantly in this era of a dynasty's decline, warring factions, and the rise of Demon Fiends.
From the “Red Rope Copper Body Skill,” honed by the toil of mining, to the immaculate and eternal “Vajra Prison Guardian Scripture”;
From the “Flying Leg” for steps as swift as flight, to “Floating Light and Glancing Shadow” for walking on air;
From “Tiger-Leopard Thunderous Roar” which spews forth qi arrows, to the “Golden Crow Illuminates the World Skill” that can incinerate mountains and boil the seas!
